{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a6db961afb5e711ab8c4bd0b33af2c4a7d2cd37feec109b0acacd7ca6ccaf08b", "ja": "（杏奈と奈緒が出演する映画の撮影もいよいよ\nクライマックス。ふたりも手応えがありそうだ）", "zh": "（杏奈和奈绪出演的电影拍摄终于进入高潮。看来两人也很有成就感）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "e2cd09f743c081f4aeec7ab4a0d0ca5323ff9923889fecfc3e2319d4f2ef57e8", "ja": "なあ、杏奈！\n今のとこ、メッチャええ感じやなかった！？", "zh": "喂，杏奈！  \n刚才那段感觉超棒的，不是吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "aeff9ce2ae21b868ad504fef0ff07823cef8c63d2f99a5085141eaaad287d071", "ja": "うん……奈緒さん、カッコよくて……\n杏奈も、やりやすかったよ……。", "zh": "嗯……奈绪很帅气……\n杏奈演起来也……很顺利哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "7a6e7af8461f60b66c0f7bf624eade3bcf36ae99d8482a33169462cbcd812287", "ja": "杏奈、なんてええ子や……。うう、アカーン！\nクールな役やから我慢しとったのに～！　ぐすっ。", "zh": "杏奈，你真是个好孩子……呜呜，不行啦！\n明明为了演好冷酷的角色一直忍着的～！呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c2569566c850dcafa448f32862c9f9b7604599017ce2f89c8d3e394983069e13", "ja": "ふたりとも、お疲れ様……って、泣いてるのか？", "zh": "两位都辛苦了……等等，你们是在哭吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "f0be7b5652a733ef81dd13ac521addef60dcdcc96dbca8f43d444481b47a5c5f", "ja": "だって、杏奈の演技を思い出したら……うう～。\n最後の笑顔とか、反則やって！", "zh": "因为想起杏奈的演技……呜呜～。\n最后那个笑容什么的，太犯规了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "dbb9c998d11e46909251977cdc3521948f191101b4e243a159c01d0ac3682bfa", "ja": "今まで怯えとった子が、あんな嬉しそうに……！\n杏奈、いったいどうなってるん？", "zh": "之前一直害怕的孩子，居然笑得那么开心……！杏奈，你到底是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "9bc935ded47eeb9940029a6140570eb8d51b41a3d3840f4fabe3ba3015b6109e", "ja": "ええと……杏奈は、いつも通りだよ……？　杏奈とは\n違う子だけど……わかるところも、あったから……。", "zh": "那个……杏奈一直都是这样啊……？虽然是和杏奈不同的孩子……但也有些地方让杏奈感同身受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "f2b176a3570120b50c3d640f8ed93d8c482a1722d957f95c7da8bcf323144bfa", "ja": "えぇっ！？　杏奈も謎の組織に追われたことあるん！？\n……{$P$}さん、ほんま？", "zh": "诶！？杏奈也被神秘组织追捕过吗！？\n……{$P$}先生，真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7d39a25d064fb08f373a41d71b1abf58f020537538e99f5dad505d695cd12ea4", "ja": "な、ないない！　……ないよな、杏奈！？", "zh": "没、没有！……对吧，杏奈！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "b9f32d76e069a14dd651fbc5c2f12b8790001829bbe9ee91ad9d28b62debe607", "ja": "ないよ……？　えと、杏奈が言ったのは……ひとりで\n寂しいとか、ご飯が、おいしいとかのことで……。", "zh": "没有哦……？呃，杏奈说的是……一个人很寂寞啦，饭很好吃啦之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "33cbaa7197b817f2ad7153e8482ad6b88b387feb5d007ccde9abd84a1107cc8c", "ja": "杏奈は、{$P$}さんが見つけてくれて\n……すごく、うれしかったなって、思ったから……。", "zh": "因为是{$P$}先生找到了杏奈……所以杏奈觉得……真的特别开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "b9c8ea0c80f3f9a420b4dfa52d30dc8ffee410f0c03307b0212a1f9a13fb5ea5", "ja": "映画で、ナオさんが見つけてくれた時も……同じ……。\n最後も……奈緒さんの顔みたら、うれしくて……。", "zh": "电影里，直子小姐找到我的时候……也是……一样的感觉……。\n最后……看到奈绪小姐的脸，好开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "4846b3a45f966de8717351b2ec08f208342a3613be9004f5bb60503b1f17caa8", "ja": "杏奈～……！　もう二度と、一人にせぇへんからなっ！", "zh": "杏奈～……！以后我再也不会让你一个人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f79f47a8a749790a59a64a307d8cd019a70fa7beb8dd90fc6dee05c6f7eea663", "ja": "奈緒！？　気持ちはわかるけど、ちょっと落ち着こう。\nほら。メイクが崩れてきた……。", "zh": "奈绪！？虽然我很理解你的心情，但先冷静一下。\n你看，妆都要花了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "567b531ef694901eaad6e5499b8ddaff2b188849cbcea2630a4277e52ae6805a", "ja": "ぐすっ、すんません……。\nまだ撮影残ってんのに。ちょっと直してきます！", "zh": "抽泣……对不起……  \n明明还剩下拍摄工作。我去补一下妆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "f61bf7d47455192f4452dbd9ac2a1a2150bfa093fb58192e9478996364009a41", "ja": "奈緒さん……行っちゃった……。\n大丈夫、かな……？", "zh": "奈绪姐……走掉了……\n她、没事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6b4c8b83eca55e79cabb5b4146d6d79f261d90795fd2d9cc7eff18bd9faa4b06", "ja": "心配ないよ。少し感情が入りすぎただけだから。\nそれだけ、杏奈の演技が真に迫ってたってことだ。", "zh": "不用担心。只是稍微投入了太多感情而已。\n这就说明，杏奈的演技非常逼真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "f76b90f52d2683ff50495916d195519fec120dad602c55890f842e961d350afc", "ja": "……えへへ♪　ねえ、{$P$}さん。\n続編ができたら、もっと楽しいかな……？", "zh": "……嘿嘿♪ 对了，{$P$}先生。\n要是能拍续集，会不会更开心呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a2fea8a463343dc26b5c199246efbde5629fab7412425cb9648e24ba6ba0744f", "ja": "続編？", "zh": "续集？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "57edad12340d2f054cae7af1dfafa70fcfe0d248378b9cfe30fe955ae49327b1", "ja": "うん……。ふたりのお話の続き……。\n今度は、笑顔でいっぱいのがいいなぁ……。", "zh": "嗯……两个人故事的后续……\n这次，希望能是充满笑容的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0514_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0514_1021_p", "source_sha256": "b43f91a8863132d817bcbae218b3543b1245709bd41a3fc45c112c3633e0ee50", "ja": "（杏奈と奈緒の思いがたくさん込められた映画は、完成\n間近だ。続編か……今度、企画書書いてみようかな？）", "zh": "（倾注了杏奈和奈绪许多心血的电影，马上就要完成了。续集吗……下次要不要试着写份企划书呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
